main.content:
There are a number of '''seasonal events''' reflected in ''Valheim''. Currently, these include Midsummer, Halloween, Yule (Christmas). These events are marked by the availability of items that can only be crafted (or purchased) during this time.

These items are mainly cosmetic, but some provide a small amount of [[Comfort]]. Items created during these seasons remain once the season ends, but once destroyed cannot be remade.

== Midsummer ==
The following items become available during Midsummer ({{#formatdate:1 Jun|dmy}} – {{#formatdate:6 Jul|dmy}})

* {{Item link|Maypole|size=48px}}
* {{Item link|Midsummer Crown|size=48px}}

== Halloween ==
The following items become available during Halloween ({{#formatdate:1 Oct|dmy}} – {{#formatdate:6 Nov|dmy}})

* {{Item link|Pointy Hat|size=48px}}
* {{Item link|Jack-O-Turnip|size=48px}}

== Yule (Christmas) ==
The following items become available at Christmas ({{#formatdate:1 Dec|dmy}} – {{#formatdate:6 Jan|dmy}})

* {{Item link|Yule Hat|size=48px}} (purchasable from [[Haldor]])
* {{Item link|Yule Tree|size=48px}}
* {{Item link|Yule wreath|size=48px}}
* {{Item link|Yule garland|size=48px}}
* {{Item link|Mistletoe|size=48px}}
* Yuleklapp ({{Item link|Yuleklapp (small)}}, {{Item link|Yuleklapp (medium)}} and {{Item link|Yuleklapp (large)}})

